{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_010_unetr-title\">UNETR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">多深度 ViT token skips 连接到卷积 U 形解码器的 3D hybrid。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">3D hybrid segmentation architecture connecting multi-depth Vision Transformer token representations to a convolutional U-shaped decoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 医学体数据</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D medical imaging volume</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高分辨率 3D 语义分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution 3D volumetric semantic segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/WACV2022/html/Hatamizadeh_UNETR_Transformers_for_3D_Medical_Image_Segmentation_WACV_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_010_unetr')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_010_unetr')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"UNETR original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/1c0267ddbd9fd6876f83.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_010_unetr\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_010_unetr')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_010_unetr\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D Volume</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Volume</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">体数据按非重叠 3D patch 切分。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"体数据按非重叠 3D patch 切分。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D Volume\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Volume\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Volume</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体数据按非重叠 3D patch 切分。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个体 patch 线性投影为 token，并加入位置编码。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D Patch Tokens to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D Patch Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Patch Tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Patch Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个体 patch 线性投影为 token，并加入位置编码。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D Patch Tokens to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"浅层 token 保留较多局部与位置细节。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT L3 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"ViT L3\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT L3\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT L3</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">浅层 token 保留较多局部与位置细节。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT L3 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"中层全局 self-attention 逐步形成体积语义。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT L6/L9 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"ViT L6/L9\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT L6/L9\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT L6/L9</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">中层全局 self-attention 逐步形成体积语义。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT L6/L9 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"深层 token 具有一层可达全局的体上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT L12 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"ViT L12\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT L12\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT L12</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">深层 token 具有一层可达全局的体上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT L12 within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"不同深度 token reshape，并经卷积投影为多尺度体特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Token→3D Map within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Token→3D Map\" data-node-name-en=\"Token→3D Map\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Token→3D Map</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">不同深度 token reshape，并经卷积投影为多尺度体特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Token→3D Map within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积逐级上采样并融合 Transformer skip。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CNN Decoder within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"CNN Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CNN Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积逐级上采样并融合 Transformer skip。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CNN Decoder within the core vit cnn 3d decoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"直接从输入卷积路径补充最高分辨率定位信息。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies CNN Skip to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"浅层 CNN Skip\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN Skip\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">浅层 CNN Skip</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Skip</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">直接从输入卷积路径补充最高分辨率定位信息。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies CNN Skip to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积头输出每体素类别 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces high-resolution 3d volumetric semantic segmentation via 3D Seg Head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"3D Seg Head\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Seg Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_010_unetr', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Seg Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积头输出每体素类别 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces high-resolution 3d volumetric semantic segmentation via 3D Seg Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"UNETR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · ViT 多深度 token 投影到 CNN 解码器</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Depth 3D ViT Token Projection into Convolutional Decoder Stages</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"UNETR：核心公式 · ViT 多深度 token 投影到 CNN 解码器\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"10\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.176106pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.850917 -69.079189 249.105157 9.176106\" width=\"249.105157pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-3.275389V-3.831212H.615376V-3.275389H5.697191ZM5.697191-1.260528V-1.816352H.615376V-1.260528H5.697191Z\" id=\"m010_g1-61\"></path><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666