/use><use x=\"40.064906\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-37\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"46.251698\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g14-51\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"50.884322\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"54.839487\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-73\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"59.01383\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g14-51\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"63.14832\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"66.963996\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"72.439955\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"96.864974\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-73\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"101.010229\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g7-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"108.126586\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g1-61\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"116.881463\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-41\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"121.963204\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g7-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"126.810363\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-185\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"130.526422\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-80\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"135.866382\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-97\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"140.289797\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-116\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"143.05941\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-99\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"147.333376\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-104\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"152.314696\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-51\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"157.296016\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g17-68\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"164.987177\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"168.703237\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g10-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"173.60982\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"177.425496\" xlink:href=\"#m010_g4-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">纯卷积的显式全局关系有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pure 3D CNN encoders have restricted explicit global receptive fields across large volumetric scans.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 3D patch token 的 ViT encoder 接 U 形 CNN decoder</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Tokenize 3D volumes into non-overlapping 3D patches processed by a ViT encoder, projecting intermediate layers into a 3D CNN decoder.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">从不同 Transformer 深度向 decoder 建立多尺度 skip</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Multi-depth reshape-and-deconvolution skip pathways bridging sequence-level ViT tokens back to spatial voxel grids.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把全局 Transformer encoder 系统引入 3D 医学分割</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pioneered global Transformer encoders for 3D multi-organ CT/MRI segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要范式节点；从头训练和二次注意力成本明显</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Important hybrid milestone, though flat 3D patch attention incurs high quadratic compute and data hunger from scratch.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">ViT encoder 让远隔体 patch 可通过 self-attention 直接交换信息。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">不同 Transformer 深度充当 U-Net 式 skip 层级，而非只用最终 CLS 表示。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">CNN decoder 重新注入局部上采样和高分辨率定位偏置。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Tokenize 3D volumes into non-overlapping 3D patches processed by a ViT encoder, projecting intermediate layers into a 3D CNN decoder.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Multi-depth reshape-and-deconvolution skip pathways bridging sequence-level ViT tokens back to spatial voxel grids.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Multi-Depth 3D ViT Token Projection into Convolutional Decoder Stages.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合需要远程器官关系的 3D 分割研究，但通常依赖足够数据或预训练。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">patch tokenization 与全局 O(N²) attention 会压缩小病灶并限制可用体素分辨率。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Pioneered global Transformer encoders for 3D multi-organ CT/MRI segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Important hybrid milestone, though flat 3D patch attention incurs high quadratic compute and data hunger from scratch.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/WACV2022/html/Hatamizadeh_UNETR_Transformers_for_3D_Medical_Image_Segmentation_WACV_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>UNETR: Transformers for 3D Medical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Project-MONAI/research-contributions\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
